---
// Dedicated landing page for "The Renovation & Repair Record Book"
// (LogicManse Publications, Title #4 in the Low-Content Multi-Book series;
// see Renovation_Repair_Log_Blueprint.md §04 and §06).
//
// THIS IS THE QR-CODE PAGE, NOT THE PRODUCT PAGE. It exists to hand the
// free digital companion to somebody who already owns the book and has
// just scanned the code on the back cover. The page that SELLS the book
// does not exist yet (the book is still at blueprint stage) — when it
// does it belongs in src/data/books.ts and src/pages/books/, same as the
// other three titles. Never put a buy button here: this reader has
// already bought.
//
// WHY THIS URL EXACTLY: blueprint §06 names
// `logicmanse.ca/RenovationRepairLog/` as the back-cover QR destination,
// following the same pattern as the Leia, Rental and Heart Health pages.
// The URL gets printed into the cover PDF, so it must never change.
//
// STATE OF THE BOOK, and what that means for this page:
//   - The book is NOT published. So this page is `noindex` and is left out
//     of public/sitemap.xml. When the paperback goes on sale, remove the
//     noindex tag and add the URL to the sitemap next to the other QR pages.
//   - The companion spreadsheet and its Reach form do not exist yet, and
//     blueprint §04/§07 leave open what the companion should be. The
//     COMPANION list below is written to mirror the book's own per-property
//     project sections (§03), the same model as the Rental and Heart Health
//     companions — confirm it matches what actually gets built.
//   - REACH_FORM_URL is empty, so the page shows an honest "opening
//     shortly" notice instead of a dead button. Paste the form's URL in
//     once it exists and the button appears by itself.
//
// Palette: the blueprint's §04 cover brief — warm terracotta, charcoal and
// brass, "deliberately distinct from the Rental Property Record Book's
// deep forest/bone/brass" so the two read as a matched series, with brass
// as the shared thread across the LogicManse Publications shelf.
//
// Self-contained (its own <head>/<body>, not BaseLayout/Header/Footer),
// same reasoning as the three sibling book pages: a reader arriving from
// a printed QR code has one thing to do.
//
// Route: this file's name controls the URL, so it lives at
// https://www.logicmanse.ca/RenovationRepairLog/
// public/RenovationRepairLog.html is a static redirect stub so the exact
// printed URL (no trailing slash) resolves here too.
const PAGE_TITLE = 'Your Free Renovation Tracker | LogicManse Publications';
const PAGE_DESCRIPTION =
  'Get the free digital companion to The Renovation & Repair Record Book — contractor quotes, permits, budgets and materials for every rental property you own.';
const CANONICAL_URL = 'https://www.logicmanse.ca/RenovationRepairLog/';

// Empty until the companion and its Reach form exist — see note above.
const REACH_FORM_URL = '';

// What the free download is meant to contain: parallel to the printed
// book's per-property project block (blueprint §03, pp. 7–12) and its
// vendor directory.
const COMPANION = [
  'A project overview for each property — scope, target dates and status for every renovation or repair job',
  'A side-by-side contractor quote comparison, so the cheapest quote is never the only thing you looked at',
  'A permit and inspection tracker, with the dates you applied, were issued and passed',
  'Budget versus actual by line item, with the variance worked out for you',
  'A materials and fixtures reference — the paint colour and part number you will want in two years',
  'A vendor and contractor directory, organised by trade',
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-CA">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <title>{PAGE_TITLE}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={PAGE_DESCRIPTION} />
  <link rel="canonical" href={CANONICAL_URL} />
  <meta property="og:title" content={PAGE_TITLE} />
  <meta property="og:description" content={PAGE_DESCRIPTION} />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:url" content={CANONICAL_URL} />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logo-row">
      <img src="/logo-mark.svg" alt="" />
      <span>LogicManse Publications</span>
    </div>

    <p class="eyebrow">You've got the book — here's the companion</p>
    <h1>Your Free Renovation Tracker</h1>
    <p class="sub">
      Thanks for picking up <em>The Renovation &amp; Repair Record Book</em>. The companion is
      yours — the same project pages you write by hand, with the sums done for you.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>What's inside:</h2>
      <ul class="features">
        {COMPANION.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ul>

      {REACH_FORM_URL ? (
        <>
          <a class="cta" href={REACH_FORM_URL}>Send Me the Tracker →</a>
          <p class="fineprint">Takes 10 seconds. We'll email you the link right away.</p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <div class="pending">
          <p><strong>The download opens shortly.</strong></p>
          <p>
            If you've just scanned the code on the back of the book, thank you — the free
            companion is being finished now. <a href="/contact/">Send us a message</a> and
            we'll email you the moment it's ready.
          </p>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>

    <p class="hint">
      More from the same shelf:
      <a href="/books/">see every LogicManse book →</a>
    </p>

    <footer>
      Written by @Antz · A LogicManse Publication<br />
      <a href="/">logicmanse.ca</a>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <style>
    :root {
      --terracotta: #B5573A;
      --terracotta-dark: #8F4229;
      --charcoal: #2E2E30;
      --brass: #B08D4F;
      --paper: #F6EFE7;
      --text: #333333;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper) 0%, #ffffff 380px);
    }
    .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 80px; }
    .logo-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .logo-row img { height: 44px; width: 44px; }
    .logo-row span {
      font-family: Merriweather, Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--charcoal);
    }
    .eyebrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--brass);
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: var(--charcoal);
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }
    .sub {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #666;
      margin: 0 0 36px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 2px solid var(--terracotta);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .card h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--charcoal);
    }
    ul.features {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 20px 0 30px;
    }
    ul.features li {
      padding: 10px 0 10px 34px;
      position: relative;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f2f2f2;
    }
    ul.features li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    ul.features li::before {
      content: "\2022";
      color: var(--brass);
      font-weight: 700;
      position: absolute;
      left: 12px;
      top: 9px;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .cta {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--terracotta);
      color: #fff !important;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 10px 0 8px;
      transition: transform 0.1s ease, background 0.15s ease;
    }
    .cta:hover { background: var(--terracotta-dark); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .fineprint {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #999;
      margin: 0;
    }
    /* Shown until REACH_FORM_URL is filled in — see the note at the top. */
    .pending {
      background: var(--paper);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--brass);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }
    .pending p { margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.55; }
    .pending p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .pending a { color: var(--terracotta-dark); font-weight: 600; }
    .hint {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #888;
      margin: 26px 0 0;
    }
    .hint a { color: var(--terracotta-dark); font-weight: 600; }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 50px;
      padding-top: 26px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #777;
    }
    footer a { color: var(--terracotta-dark); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
      .card { padding: 26px 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
